From {{inh|ca|pro|}} (compare {{cog|oc|tron}}), from {{inh|ca|la|tonus||thunderclap; sound, tone}} (possibly through a {{inh|ca|LL.|-}} or {{inh|ca|VL.||*tronus}}<ref>http://www.diccionari.cat/lexicx.jsp?GECART=0137899</ref>), incremented with an -r- due to influence from {{m|la||*tronitus}} < {{m|la|tonitrus}}), and ultimately from {{der|ca|grc|τόνος}}; compare also {{cog|pt|trom}}, {{cog|es|trueno}}). Compare the borrowed doublet {{doublet|to|lang=ca|notext=1}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ca-IPA}}

===Noun===
{{ca-noun|m|trons}}

